# The files of the repository that the archive of the sources leaves out
# (GAOL v5): the notes of the work on GAOL v5, which serve its maintainers and
# not the users of a version, and the settings of the maintainers' tools. Only
# the development branch dev holds them, and this file, which leaves itself
# out: the branch of the versions, configure-clean, has neither.
# git archive, and so meson dist, which archives the commit with it, reads
# export-ignore; CMake leaves them out of package_source with
# CPACK_SOURCE_IGNORE_FILES (CMakeLists.txt), and make dist of the autotools
# build does not list them in its EXTRA_DIST (Makefile.am): the three
# archives hold the same files, on dev as on configure-clean.
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/TODO.md export-ignore
/TODO_AFTER.md export-ignore
/TODO_DONE.md export-ignore
/STEP.md export-ignore
/process.md export-ignore
/todo-notes export-ignore
/.claude export-ignore
